COMMENT ON TABLE gbdp.gold_gbdp.dim_team IS 'Team dimension, SCD2. Built each day from that day\'s games (every source with a games entity except kbo_api) and from the MLB season team list (silver mlb_statsapi/teams), which also covers MLB teams without a game that day. Each dt is a full snapshot of every version known by then. Grain: one row per team_id per version (valid_from_dt), within each dt snapshot. Sources: mlb_statsapi, npb_spaia, indy_local, kbo_local, lmb_local, retrosheet_local. Caveat: Always filter to one dt (normally the latest) and is_current = true, or use the view v_team_current. Caveat: Versions change when team_name, team_abbrev, home_city or league_id change. Caveat: KBO teams are missing. dim_team does not read kbo_api games, so the team_ids in fact_game and the KBO box scores have no dim_team row. Caveat: On a day with no silver mlb_statsapi/teams partition, team_abbrev and home_city are carried over from the previous snapshot (not one dated before a rebuild\'s --fresh-dims-before date); with no earlier snapshot they are null. P...';

